 "奇偶性判断搞混"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "模运算计算错误"}]}]}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "borderColor": "#3b82f6", "icon": "📊"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "刷题建议：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "整除和奇偶是解不定方程的两大工具。先用整除缩小范围，再用奇偶排除。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '数量关系-方程与不定方程-整除与奇偶约束的核心知识点和解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "方程与不定方程", "整除与奇偶约束"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_eq_div_parity", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
